Oracle 1/3 (Gemini 3.1 Pro) failed to produce a verified tour for the standard preset. The harness has moved to a distinct vendor and fresh seed; I’ll inspect parse/verification reasons once the level completes to rule out a false negative.
diff --git a/gen_2508_11570.py b/gen_2508_11570.py
